      },
      "rev_n_2_0c1ebf_2": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_0c1ebf_2",
        "node_id": "n_2_0c1ebf",
        "thought_text": "The issue arises because the current implementation does not correctly account for the sum of all possible walks when encountering a '*'. Specifically, the calculation for '*' should consider the contribution of each possible move ('L', 'R', 'P') separately and then sum these contributions. This ensures that all permutations of the '*' are correctly evaluated.",
